WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:08.360
Our mission is to gather the Seven Mermaid Princesses and seven pearls to summon forth Aqua Regina-sama.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.280
We're feeling a bit relieved since Karen joined our side,

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.450
but Karen's twin sister, Noelle, is still trapped in Gaito's lair.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.410
But we're never, ever going to lose to them!

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:24.410
All right! Today again with our Pichi Pichi Voices, it's Live Start!

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:19.740
Even though we've searched this area extensively, we still can't find any clues to where Gaito's lair is.

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:22.740
Miracle on a Snowy Night.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:32.370
What exactly happened to Lucia? She's been so focused recently.

00:02:32.370 --> 00:02:36.300
She even turned down Kaito-kun's offer to go skiing.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:42.300
It might be because of Nikora-san or Hippo, but Lucia has her own way of thinking, right?

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:47.620
Hey, Hanon, Rina. Let's search this area once more!

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:52.610
Snow?

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:58.830
Right when I realized it was getting colder and colder, it starts to snow.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.780
Let's go back.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.910
We're going to catch a cold.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:06.320
Lucia! Let's go back to Pearl Piari for now.

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.880
No! Let's look once more!

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:12.450
We have to find some clue as to where Gaito's lair is, no matter what!

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.120
See?

00:03:16.120 --> 00:03:17.460
You're a stubborn girl, aren't you?

00:03:21.230 --> 00:03:23.990
Just as I thought it was getting colder, it started snowing, huh?

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:26.800
I guess the beach house has to close up today.

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:30.470
Come to think of it, we have to gather at the ski bus at 8 o'clock.

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:34.230
But don't you think that there'll be fewer girls who participate in the ski event this time?

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:35.620
Rina-chan didn't come, either.

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:38.430
But you might find your Valentine love there.

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:41.110
But I wonder if the conditions for Valentine love will be perfect.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:42.500
What do you think, Kaito?

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:45.240
Sorry, I wasn't listening...

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:49.880
Kaito, is it just me or are you not feeling energetic today?

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:51.710
Did you catch a cold or something?

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.000
No, it's nothing.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.510
Come to think of it, did Lucia-chan say she'd come to the ski event this time?

00:03:57.280 --> 00:03:59.830
Yeah, I think so.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:10.700
It seems like it's snowing up on the surface or something.

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:14.920
If we go out to find the Mermaid Princesses in this weather, it'd be troublesome, wouldn't it?

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:17.360
Everybody, would any of you like to have a cup of tea?

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:19.720
How thoughtful of you, Yuuri.

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:21.120
I'm really grateful!

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:24.680
Even at the bottom of the sea, it's really chilly, isn't it?

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:26.500
Eh? Where's Maria?

00:04:26.500 --> 00:04:31.160
I don't really know, but she's been in the library since this morning.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.330
I think she's reading manga.

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:39.490
This year, I'll definitely capture the Mermaid Princesses.

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:42.720
With that, I'll surely take back Gaito-sama's love for me.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.920
You did well, Maria.

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.930
It's nothing...

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.430
I shall give you my love as a reward.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:52.150
Eh? Gaito-sama is giving his love to me?

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:56.110
How bold of you. Besides, it's still early in the day...

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:03.270
Oww... huh?

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:05.420
I found it! Here it is! Here it is!

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:07.740
Umm... so by doing this...

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:09.240
Alright, I understand.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.620
O Goddess of the Aurora.

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:14.020
O Spirit of Snow and King of Ice.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:17.210
Bestow upon me the power of the cold.

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:21.960
Blizzard... Blow!

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:34.000
I wonder if it worked.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:35.480
I didn't feel anything, but...

00:05:36.660 --> 00:05:39.940
I think I heard some loud voices coming from in here...

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:48.910
Oh? This magic book is stronger than I expected.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.460
It's really warm and delicious.

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:03.420
Our bodies got really cold, so it's the best to have a cup of hot milk.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:07.040
Geez. What would you do if all of you caught a cold!?

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:09.260
In the first place, Gaito's lair moves!

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:13.660
It's not so easy to find, even if you start searching all of a sudden.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:17.880
You're right, but it's rare for Lucia to be so focused.

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:22.720
She's finally aware that she's a Mermaid Princess, so it's alright isn't it?

00:06:22.720 --> 00:06:26.340
That's something to be happy about, if you look at it from that perspective...

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:28.450
Oh yeah, what's Lucia doing now?

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:32.500
I wonder. I saw her doing something in the kitchen just now.

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.040
I'm going out!

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:37.490
Lucia, where are you going at such a time?

00:06:37.490 --> 00:06:41.140
I'm going to see Kaito and give him the lunch box I made.

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.000
I'm off!

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:49.690
She's forcing herself, but as I thought, she really wanted to go with Kaito to the ski event.

00:06:49.690 --> 00:06:53.680
Yeah. She at least wanted to prepare a lunch box for him.

00:06:58.020 --> 00:06:59.990
It's almost time to set off.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:03.150
Well everyone, please board the bus.

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:09.820
Lucia, what's up? Aren't you coming to the ski event this time?

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:13.300
I have to help out at the hotel.

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:16.350
That's disappointing.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:19.160
I was thinking of using this chance to teach you snowboarding.

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:22.310
I'm sorry, Kaito.

00:07:22.310 --> 00:07:26.430
On the upside, I'll make a lunch box and give it to you.

00:07:26.430 --> 00:07:27.590
You have to eat it on the bus, okay?

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.870
Yeah. I look forward to it.

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:33.550
I wonder if she's coming.

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:36.820
Doumoto-kun, please hurry up and board the bus.

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:38.340
We're setting off.

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:39.870
Yes!

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:46.400
I have to hurry! The bus for the ski event is about to leave!

00:07:52.420 --> 00:07:56.160
I'll use that magic to freeze the whole city, and the Mermaid Princesses along with it.

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:57.790
Then, I'll take my time to find them.

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.100
O Goddess of the Aurora.

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:03.140
O Spirit of Snow and King of Ice.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:06.630
Bestow upon me the power of the cold.

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:11.090
Violent... Snowstorm!

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.540
Driver, what's the situation?

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:35.440
I'm sorry, we can't leave in this blizzard.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.070
What? Is the ski event going to be canceled?

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:42.820
What will happen to my Valentine love!?

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.210
Lucia.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:09:00.810
I have to do my best and quickly deliver this lunch box to Kaito!

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:04.050
Thank goodness, the bus hasn't left yet.

00:09:04.050 --> 00:09:05.230
I made it in time.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:07.690
Eh?

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:13.570
Where did Kaito and everyone else go?

00:09:16.270 --> 00:09:22.650
Could it be that the ski event got canceled because of this blizzard, and Kaito went home?

00:09:27.470 --> 00:09:29.230
The blizzard is getting stronger.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:31.340
I wonder if Lucia will be okay?

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:34.290
Lucia isn't a child, so she'll be alright.

00:09:34.290 --> 00:09:37.180
Once she delivers the lunch box, she'll hurry up and return home.

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:39.300
See?

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:42.770
Welcome back Lucia. You're really slow.

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.230
It's snowing really badly.

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:45.670
Kaito?

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:48.400
Kaito-kun, what's the matter? What about the ski event?

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:52.800
The event got canceled because the bus can't leave in this blizzard.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.820
But besides that, hasn't Lucia come back home?

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:59.000
She went to deliver the lunch box to you, and she hasn't returned.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.990
Didn't you see Lucia at the gathering place, Kaito?

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:05.950
If that's the case, could we have passed each other without noticing?

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:18.430
W-What's this!?

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:20.850
It's a weather vane, right?

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:25.760
This is weird. The snow's already piled up to the rooftops in this part of town.

00:10:28.680 --> 00:10:29.810
What should I do?

00:10:29.810 --> 00:10:32.480
I can't figure out which way's east or west.

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:34.650
I won't be able to go back to Pearl Piari like this.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:40.620
There's so much snow, it's left me stranded in the middle of town!

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:47.500
Kaito-kun, it's reckless to use a snowboard in this blizzard.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:50.710
That's right. Kaito, you'll be in danger.

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:55.250
Lucia went to deliver her lunch box to me; that's why she's in danger.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.120
You're right, but...

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:02.180
Even if it doesn't look like it, Lucia's lunch box is the best.

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:06.640
That's why before it freezes, I'll find her.

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:09.560
Kaito!

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:10.810
There he goes.

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:17.530
If Kaito-san went to find her, we won't have to worry about Lucia-san.

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:21.990
It's cold. I guess I'll go and take a hot bath and then go to sleep.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:23.430
What are you saying, Hippo!?

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:24.710
We're going too!

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:27.820
Hippo, you are a penguin, so you must be well-suited for the snow, right!?

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:29.160
Then, lead the way!

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:35.120
Don't say such unreasonable things!

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.960
Even if I don't look like it, I'm afraid of the cold!

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.960
How can you say you can't go!

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:40.750
I'm sorry.

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:47.510
Where is this place?

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:48.590
I'm lost.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:52.770
My legs are getting numb, I can't move them.

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:58.020
I made a lunch box for Kaito, but...

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:06.820
Where are you?

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.110
Lucia!

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:08.900
Where are you!?

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:14.740
Lucia...

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:42.390
Hippo, keep it up!

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:43.790
Do your best, Hippo!

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:47.490
Is this how you two would use a penguin!?

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:49.610
That is...

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:51.240
What's the matter, Rina?

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:54.030
Hanon, take a look at that slope.

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:54.770
Eh?

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:03.260
Snow, snow! Keep on snowing!

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:06.720
Blow, blow! Become a more violent blizzard!

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:08.540
That's Maria!

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:11.480
So she's the one who caused all this.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:12.390
Let's go, Hanon.

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:12.890
Okay.

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:18.940
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:13:19.660 --> 00:13:21.180
Green Pearl Voice!

00:13:32.900 --> 00:13:35.860
Snow, snow! Keep on snowing!

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:39.340
Blow, blow! Become a more violent blizzard!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:45.130
You don't give a thought about people, causing a blizzard in such a peaceful city.

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.500
I can't forgive you!

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:49.100
Well, return to the sea obediently.

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:52.720
Oh my. Welcome, Mermaid Princess-chan.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:54.730
You think you are in a position to say that?

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:58.650
Today, I'm completely different from my usual self.

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:00.950
O Goddess of the Aurora.

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:03.930
O Spirit of Snow and King of Ice.

00:14:03.930 --> 00:14:07.320
Bestow upon me the power of the cold.

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:13.910
Turn the Mermaid Princesses in front of me into snowmen!

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:29.540
That scared me...

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:37.520
I turned two Mermaid Princesses into snowmen.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:45.110
That book seems like it's the source of her power.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.030
Goodbye.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:49.680
How do you feel, Mermaid Princess-sama?

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:53.100
If you can sing in that state, let me see you try.

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:56.590
If you really want us to.

00:14:57.050 --> 00:14:59.450
Shall we sing for you wholeheartedly?

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:00.940
Eh!?

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:07.090
We didn't turn into snowmen like you thought.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.800
That's too bad, isn't it, Maria?

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:11.230
It's irritating!

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:16.330
You two escaped well. I applaud you two, for now.

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.700
But, it won't be so easy this time.

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:21.750
Because today, I'm different from my usual self.

00:15:22.510 --> 00:15:25.100
How are you different from your usual self?

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:27.760
It's because of this magic book!

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:31.610
Where is it?

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:32.700
Where is the magic book!?

00:15:34.780 --> 00:15:38.120
It really warms up my whole body!

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:40.690
Not here... not here... not here...

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:44.580
My very precious magic book isn't here!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:48.010
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:15:57.460 --> 00:16:02.150
Where did my precious magic book go!?

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:48.800
No!

00:16:48.800 --> 00:16:51.940
Just when I thought I could finally get Gaito-sama's love!

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:53.910
Now it's all ruined!

00:16:54.590 --> 00:16:56.370
Love Shower Pitch!

00:16:58.270 --> 00:16:59.660
How about an encore?

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:02.580
Remember this!

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:05.500
Lucia! Lucia!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.180
Where are you!?

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:08.680
Lucia!

00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:16.800
What's that light?

00:17:25.510 --> 00:17:27.020
Lucia...

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:30.230
Could she be under that pile of snow?

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:31.810
Lucia.

00:17:58.530 --> 00:17:59.250
Lucia.

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:02.910
Lucia!

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:05.560
Get a hold of yourself, Lucia!

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.640
Lucia! Hey, Lucia!

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:09.960
She's cold.

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:12.070
Her body is freezing.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:17.300
This is bad, if this continues Lucia will...

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:21.870
Lucia, wait for me a bit.

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:31.090
Lucia, I will quickly warm you up.

00:18:38.350 --> 00:18:39.010
It's done.

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:54.560
Lucia, are you alright?

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:55.400
Get a hold of yourself.

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:02.360
I can't stop her body temperature from dropping.

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:04.790
I need to warm her up more.

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:13.170
Lucia...

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.630
I'll warm you up.

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.080
Lucia...

00:19:35.160 --> 00:19:38.560
Lucia, I'm begging you! Please wake up!

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:39.450
Lucia!

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:50.330
Kaito...

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:53.640
Lucia, thank goodness. You woke up.

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:56.110
Are you alright? Aren't you cold?

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:58.660
No, I'm alright.

00:19:58.660 --> 00:19:59.760
I'm really warm.

00:20:00.730 --> 00:20:04.700
Being together with Kaito, I feel warm.

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:08.180
I'm sure it's because Kaito's heart is really warm.

00:20:09.320 --> 00:20:11.000
Lucia...

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:14.360
Kaito, I'm sorry about the lunch box.

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:17.090
It's alright. You can make it for me again.

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:17.990
Yeah.

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:45.100
It's morning?

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:46.640
Kaito.

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:54.900
Kaito... You helped me stay warm the whole night, didn't you?

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.140
Thank you.

00:20:56.140 --> 00:20:57.510
I was really warm.

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:02.010
Lucia-san.

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.440
Could it be this place was...

00:21:11.440 --> 00:21:13.290
...right in front of Pearl Piari.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:16.620
Geez, Lucia. To be trapped in this place.

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:21.630
But, to be embracing each other in that igloo.
What were you two doing for the whole night?

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:24.330
Don't get any weird ideas!

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:28.310
T-This is because Lucia was freezing, so I wanted to warm her up...

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:32.300
You had us really worried. And in the end, you two were just having lovey-dovey time.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:34.170
Seriously, you had us really worried.

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:35.510
Well, isn't it alright?

00:21:35.510 --> 00:21:37.430
Since both of them are safe and sound.

00:21:37.430 --> 00:21:43.150
Lucia, Nikora-san prepared some hot soup, and it's waiting for you when you get back.

00:21:43.150 --> 00:21:44.930
Kaito-kun, you should have some, too.

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:47.230
Come on, let's go.

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:50.400
Geez.

00:21:50.400 --> 00:21:53.160
Those two really like to make people tense.

00:21:54.110 --> 00:21:55.920
I guess that can't be helped.

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:58.160
We did make them worry.

00:21:58.160 --> 00:22:01.940
The place where we were trapped was right in front of your house.

00:22:01.940 --> 00:22:04.400
It really is something to laugh at.

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:08.600
Well, how about we go inside and have that hot soup?

00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:09.730
Yeah!

00:23:51.140 --> 00:23:52.530
Lucia, what's the matter?

00:23:52.540 --> 00:23:55.220
You know, Kaito's been acting strange recently.

00:23:55.220 --> 00:23:56.290
Strange?

00:23:56.290 --> 00:23:59.230
He asked some girl he doesn't really like out on a date.

00:23:59.230 --> 00:24:01.170
I don't know if they kissed...

00:24:01.170 --> 00:24:03.380
I don't know what Kaito's true feelings are.

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:07.910
I wonder if he even figured out that I am the mermaid from his memories.

00:24:07.910 --> 00:24:10.380
In the end, I guess I can't be his only love.

00:24:10.380 --> 00:24:11.870
What about you, Lucia?

00:24:11.870 --> 00:24:12.990
Are you fine with that?

00:24:12.990 --> 00:24:13.890
I...

00:24:13.890 --> 00:24:16.760
Next time on Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch:

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:18.030
A Couple's Feelings.

00:24:18.030 --> 00:24:19.510
How about an encore?
